{
	"$comment": "Golden vectors and policy cases for end-user API keys (Auth). Token grammar: <prefix>_<live|test>_<32 base62 secret><6 base62 CRC-32 of everything before it>, stored as SHA-256 of the whole token. The Rust format functions (extracted from kernel/access/verify/src/format.rs, parameterised by prefix) and the TypeScript reference must both match every row. Contract: docs/services/contracts/end-user-keys.md.",
